shetra.. But Kerala does better PR😂", "timestamp": 1794117067, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "srushhhh_011", "author_id": "26548974907", "id": "18503022292097369", "text": "Entire Konkan coast including Goa, Kerala and southern Maharashtra is called Parshuram's Land.", "timestamp": 1794116827, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "santosh.maski", "author_id": "4808460586", "id": "17946909075090231", "text": "The whole konkan coast is called Parashurama Shrushti...", "timestamp": 1794075458, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ft.mohankrishna.__", "author_id": "45922620142", "id": "18111440168627577", "text": "God's own country ❤️", "timestamp": 1794068969, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "quickgunmurugann", "author_id": "72178133211", "id": "18096689987153277", "text": "@kunalsmd keep barking. he's still right.", "timestamp": 1794036104, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "lukeee_887", "author_id": "66996015218", "id": "17950387785067760", "text": "Pathanamthitta 🔥", "timestamp": 1794030198, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "lighting55s", "author_id": "76421944732", "id": "17911079649568126", "text": "Alapphuzha", "timestamp": 1793986095, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "spacehuman2047", "author_id": "48324195424", "id": "18039211238893591", "text": "Let's stop associating Kerala's origin with the parashurama myth. We had a history before and the other one was just a myth created to take over and supress populations.", "timestamp": 1793901197, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "eaaswarann", "author_id": "77804793248", "id": "18140770735636059", "text": "Parasuram brought namboodiris to settle in forest by cutting down trees in western ghats. Thats how kerala was created. Out of guilt that many snakes were killed, he built temples for snakes too. Dont take literary meaning of everything", "timestamp": 1793882972, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfTvJarR7hO/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfTvJarR7hO", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor